    "revision": 1,
    "title": "Speaking and interaction practice",
    "subtitle": "A connected personal narrative",
    "context": "Tell a connected account with clear viewpoint, reference and common extended direction meanings.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U31-required-interaction-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Respond to the situation",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U31-required-interaction-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "A connected personal narrative: A partner proposes acting immediately on the first part of this account. Explain the later information they need, ask one clarification, and negotiate a suitable next step.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "昨天我和朋友准备下午三点在学校见面，我到了二楼，没有看见他。我等了二十分钟，以为朋友还没有来，有点儿不高兴。\n\n我想给他打电话，发现手机在家里。一个老师问我在等谁。我说了朋友的名字，老师说他已经来了，在三楼看书。\n\n这时候，我想起朋友昨天说的是三楼，不是二楼。那时候我一边听他说话，一边看书，听错了，以为是二楼。我就上楼去找他。\n\n朋友也在等我。他说：“我三点到了，我也等了二十分钟。”我告诉他，我在二楼等了二十分钟，以为他还没有来。因为手机在家里，我不能打电话，后来才知道他一直在三楼等我。\n\n后来我们一起看书，没有再等。回家前，我在本子上写：下次下午三点，三楼。朋友说：“下次先看明白，再出门。”这次我认真听完了。",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "My reply uses the later information instead of simply repeating the first claim."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "My clarification and proposed next step address the practical constraint."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
    ],
